# The rocker's keys are written to the kernel's gpio-keys device by hwinput (T-653): hidd reads them as from the rocker.
id: volume-keys
section: Media and sound
item: The hardware volume keys while a page plays sound: the media volume goes up and down with them and the sound keeps reaching the output sink
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.media.autoplayWithSound=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html?src=clip60av.webm&wide=1&sound=1
kit: cavekit-finger-testing.md R7
wait text status playing 20
expect sound heard 10
volume-mark
volume-key up 2
expect volume higher
volume-mark
volume-key down 2
expect volume lower
expect sound heard 10
